      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻也同样是这个想法。\n两人相约在“天皇赏（春）”再战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78b1ed6481ce0c15e12acde765014d07d458a64b83f461b9ff9c8efc55200a39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
